scenario Wi-Fi up but the API down, cache 30 h old: protective sky, C = 1 (TP8)
# SNTP sets the clock while the radio is up, so the cache's age is known: stale.
net api_down
cache stale
boot
within 9 state == DARK_IDLE
expect clock == 1
expect source == PROTECTIVE
expect why == stale
expect sky_c == 1
expect budget < 20.1           # B_max / 3
